  "body": "Our vendors have given us clear instructions: This property MUST SELL, and we will present ALL OFFERS.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 24 Venus Place - a beautifully renovated, substantial family home.\r\noffering exceptional space, flexibility, and breathtaking sunset views.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 1,123 sqm section and with a favorable building report, this impressive residence features five bedrooms and five bathrooms including two ensuites, making it ideal for large or\r\nextended families. Thoughtfully designed with upstairs and downstairs separation,\r\nit provides excellent options for extended family living, guest accommodation, or\r\nadded privacy.\r\n\r\nThe home boasts two spacious living areas, perfect for both relaxed family time\r\nand formal entertaining. The modern kitchen is a true highlight, complete with a\r\nchef's oven and gas cooking - designed for those who love to cook and host.\r\n\r\nStep outside to expansive wrap-around decks, creating seamless indoor-outdoor\r\nflow and the perfect setting for entertaining while enjoying stunning elevated views\r\nand unforgettable sunsets.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n· Spectacular views\r\n· Double internal access garage\r\n· Private off-street setting\r\n· Generous parking for family and guests\r\n· Recently renovated throughout\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to secure a spacious, move-in-ready home in a private,\r\nelevated position - offering lifestyle, comfort, and flexibility all in one.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
